<%- layout("layouts/boilerplate") %>

<main class="page-wrapper">

  <!-- page header -->
  <section class="page-header">
    <h1 class="page-title">Help & Support</h1>
    <p class="page-subtitle">
      Everything you need to know about using BookLoop.
    </p>
  </section>

  <!-- page content -->
  <section class="page-content">

    <div class="page-block">
      <h4 class="page-block-title">What is BookLoop?</h4>
      <p class="page-text">
        BookLoop is a student-to-student platform that helps you
        exchange, sell, or donate textbooks easily.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="page-block">
      <h4 class="page-block-title">How do I list a book?</h4>
      <p class="page-text">
        Go to <strong>Host a Book</strong>, fill in the book details,
        and submit the form. Your book will appear for other students.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="page-block">
      <h4 class="page-block-title">How does requesting a book work?</h4>
      <p class="page-text">
        When you request a book, the owner receives a notification.
        They can accept or reject your request.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="page-block">
      <h4 class="page-block-title">Is BookLoop free?</h4>
      <p class="page-text">
        Yes. BookLoop is free to use for students.
        Any exchange or payment happens directly between users.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="page-block">
      <h4 class="page-block-title">Still need help?</h4>
      <p class="page-text">
        Visit our <a href="/contact" class="page-link">Contact page</a>
        and send us your query.
      </p>
    </div>

  </section>

</main>